    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have become excellent at the usages of firearms, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You ignore the loading quality of firearms with which you are proficient.</p></li><li><p>Being within 5 feet of a hostile creature doesn't impose disadvantage on your ranged attack rolls.</p></li><li><p>When you use the Attack action and attack with a one-handed weapon, you can use a bonus action to attack with a loaded one-handed firearm you are holding.</p></li></ul>",
